  "readmeFile": "PackageReadme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.3.0 — Tier 1 improvements: fix XlsIO 33.2.3 template-markers parser quirk (workaround in ExcelReportRenderer, verified by regression test); PDF metadata (Title/Author/Subject/Keywords/Creator) via DocumentInformation; PDF/A-1b/2b/3b conformance via converter settings; RequiredFields[] + RequiredFieldsMode (Throw/Warn/Ignore) fail-fast validation; Excel and PowerPoint watermark (shape-based, complementing existing Word+PDF); placeholder-based image injection ({{image:key}} for Word/PPT, %image:key% for Excel) backed by ReportImage (byte[] + contentType + optional dimensions); ReportContext fluent builder (Create().With(...).WithCollection(...).WithImage(...)) backed by ExpandoObject and DataBinding IDictionary support. +16 tests (total 50). Backward compatible.",
